{"shortname": "tuxpaint", "name": "Tux Paint", "_id": "506c9808fd48f83ea9b81bdc", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/tuxpaint/", "private": false, "short_description": "Tux Paint is a free, award-winning drawing program originally created for children ages 3 to 12, but enjoyed by all! It combines an easy-to-use interface, fun sound effects, and an encouraging cartoon mascot who guides children as they use the program.\r\n\r\nYou're presented with a blank canvas and a variety of drawing tools to help them be creative. Along with paintbrush, shapes and text, Tux Paint includes a \"stamp\" feature to add pre-drawn or photographic imagery to pictures, and a set of \"magic tools\" that provide filter effects (like blur, tint and waves) and interesting drawing tools (like train tracks, bubbles and grass).\r\n\r\nTux Paint includes a collection of \"starter\" images, both coloring-book style and photo-realistic, and a large collections of stamps are available as a separate download. Additional content can be added by parents & teachers, or downloaded from 3rd parties.\r\n\r\nTux Paint is available for Windows, macOS, Android, Linux, & Haiku operating systems, among others.", "creation_date": "2002-11-12", "summary": "An award-winning drawing program for children of all ages", "external_homepage": "https://tuxpaint.org/", "video_url": null, "socialnetworks": [{"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Twitter"}, {"accounturl": "https://www.facebook.com/TuxPaint/", "socialnetwork": "Facebook"}, {"accounturl": "@tuxpaint@floss.social", "socialnetwork": "Fediverse"}, {"accounturl": "https://www.instagram.com/tuxpaintdevs/", "socialnetwork": "Instagram"}], "status": "active", "moved_to_url": "", "preferred_support_tool": "_url", "preferred_support_url": "https://tuxpaint.org/contact/", "developers": [{"username": "dolphin6k", "name": "Shin-ichi TOYAMA", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/dolphin6k/"}, {"username": "dubyk", "name": "Serhij Dubyk", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/dub